damaged_code:
```rust
// A single DB model representing two totally distinct domain tables
#[derive(DBTable)]
struct Party {
    id: u64,
    party_type: String, // "Person" or "Company"
    first_name: Option<String>, // Null for Company
    registration_number: Option<String>, // Null for Person
}
```

fix:
Use Separate Table Inheritance, mapping Person and Company to separate physical database tables.
```rust
struct Person {
    id: u64,
    first_name: String,
}

struct Company {
    id: u64,
    registration_number: String,
}
```
